  "title": "10-minute firm butt workout",
  "creator": "NHS",
  "description": "Five glute and thigh moves from the NHS 10-minute series: squats, side-lying leg raises, bridges, one-leg kickbacks and lunges, 8 to 10 reps each, with single-leg moves done on both sides. No equipment and floor-friendly, so it works as a beginner lower-body session. Add a second round if 10 minutes feels light. Warm up first with the NHS 6-minute warm-up (nhs-6-min-warm-up) and finish with the 5-minute stretch (nhs-5-min-cool-down-stretch).",
